  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A tendril of inky darkness reaches out from you to drain the life of a creature you can see within range.</p><p>The target makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, it takes 6d8 Necrotic damage, and on each of your later turns you can take a Bonus Action to deal 2d8 Necrotic damage to it automatically. The spell ends if the target is ever outside the spell’s range or has Total Cover from you. On a success, it takes half the initial damage only, and the spell ends.</p><p>Whenever this spell deals damage to the target, you regain Hit Points equal to half the Necrotic damage dealt.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The initial damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 5.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-HPPMdyBSXHIPK4pX\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Heal yourself by half the Necrotic damage dealt each time.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
